<title>FRANCE: Paribas issues &quot;buy&quot; advice on Accor.</title>
<headline>Paribas issues &quot;buy&quot; advice on Accor.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paribas Capital Markets has issued a &quot;buy&quot; rating on Accor, which helped to boost the share price.</p>
<p>Accor was up 2.6 percent at 749 francs at 1218 GMT.</p>
<p>Paribas changed from sell to neutral on January 15, then upgraded to buy on January 23 and returned to neutral on February 5 after its previous share price goal had been reached.</p>
</text>
